+glyph_cache.zig                | mirror | the table grows as entries are added, and every entry is still found afterwards
+glyph_cache.zig                | mirror | more changed glyphs than the pending list holds mark their page for a full upload
+glyph_cache.zig                | mirror | clear empties the pages and marks every page for a full upload
+glyph_cache.zig                | mirror | markAllDirty queues every page and keeps the glyphs
+glyph_cache.zig                | mirror | missing codepoints are counted
+glyph_cache.zig                | mirror | invalid options are refused before anything is allocated
